        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "9320fbeb-fe12-3afb-8891-4e4c511d7988",
                "word": "dislocation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "888c903c-fe41-4e99-ab30-b196b7f6d993",
                        "entry_id": "9320fbeb-fe12-3afb-8891-4e4c511d7988",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "dislocations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "57582aa5-074f-3135-baf5-f180bd976eef",
                        "entry_id": "9320fbeb-fe12-3afb-8891-4e4c511d7988",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Déplacement d’une ou de plusieurs parties d’un tout."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb71a13e-4fbf-47c5-85ba-fdaa30216aa7",
                                "sense_id": "57582aa5-074f-3135-baf5-f180bd976eef",
                                "text": "La tempête devenait décidément si violente, la mer se faisait si monstrueuse, qu’on pouvait justement redouter une dislocation de l’icefield."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a38d510-54c6-4308-a62d-5d027652b6b6",
                                "sense_id": "57582aa5-074f-3135-baf5-f180bd976eef",
                                "text": "Depuis la fin de l’Empire romain, ou, mieux, depuis la dislocation de l’Empire de Charlemagne, l’Europe occidentale nous apparaît divisée en nations, […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c6294fe-ad85-416f-8994-074be42082db",
                                "sense_id": "57582aa5-074f-3135-baf5-f180bd976eef",
                                "text": "Lorsqu’il [un énorme floe] s’arc-bouterait d’un côté sur le Cap Hope, de l’autre sur le Cap Tobin, toute issue serait fermée ; il nous faudrait attendre sa dislocation […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4fe0b6d8-9f3a-4561-9743-00e4938b4a42",
                                "sense_id": "57582aa5-074f-3135-baf5-f180bd976eef",
                                "text": "De Moutardon à la Budie, au N. de Champagne-Mouton sont alignées plusieurs dislocations qui ramènent en affleurement les marnes du Lias supérieur à Moutardon, le Lias inférieur et moyen à Vieux-Ruffec, […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "178f7b19-7b51-3487-8af5-aac773a79a5a",
                        "entry_id": "9320fbeb-fe12-3afb-8891-4e4c511d7988",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Déboîtement des os, luxation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa143ae5-a5d7-44f4-86d0-5de0ca7f840f",
                                "sense_id": "178f7b19-7b51-3487-8af5-aac773a79a5a",
                                "text": "La dislocation d’un membre."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf344b4f-091e-477a-9ca0-21ba973f254c",
                                "sense_id": "178f7b19-7b51-3487-8af5-aac773a79a5a",
                                "text": "La dislocation de ses vertèbres, ce n’est pas seulement la cause de la mort, c’est encore et c’est surtout la preuve irréfutable de l’assassinat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab970044-0685-44ff-bca0-615d6e3000ba",
                                "sense_id": "178f7b19-7b51-3487-8af5-aac773a79a5a",
                                "text": "D’abord dislocation nucale. Manuelle. Le gosse a dû morfler."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e07d37b9-24fb-3a44-8c86-1f5f557fb67e",
                        "entry_id": "9320fbeb-fe12-3afb-8891-4e4c511d7988",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Exercice acrobatique pratiqué par un contorsionniste."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "372841b9-a9af-4581-af94-762f5fba89bd",
                                "sense_id": "e07d37b9-24fb-3a44-8c86-1f5f557fb67e",
                                "text": "Vous connaissez le cirque Gassot ? Non. Eh bien ! ce n’est pas un grand, grand cirque, mais c’est pourtant un cirque. Ils avaient besoin d’un enfant pour la dislocation et Garofoli me loua au père Gassot. Je suis resté avec lui jusqu’à lundi dernier, et puis on m’a renvoyé parce que j’ai la tête trop grosse maintenant pour entrer dans la boîte, et aussi trop sensible."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0882db3-d24f-46db-99b4-639825204220",
                                "sense_id": "e07d37b9-24fb-3a44-8c86-1f5f557fb67e",
                                "text": "Ses mains descendaient si bas qu’il aurait pu, croyait-on, ramasser des pierres sans se courber, et il était si drôlement bâti et configuré que ses moindres gestes ressemblaient à des exercices de dislocation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdf6355b-b455-44f1-bb78-1a4991719acb",
                                "sense_id": "e07d37b9-24fb-3a44-8c86-1f5f557fb67e",
                                "text": "Faguet avait pris la suite de Lemaître au feuilleton dramatique des Débats. Le journal avait certes perdu au change. La critique de Lemaître était une merveille de lucidité et de finesse, égayée de maint sourire ; celle de Faguet sans barre ni boussole, d’un arbitraire ahurissant, telle qu’une dislocation de clown funèbre."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a1511c23-5cb8-327e-9e77-ee73d408a220",
                        "entry_id": "9320fbeb-fe12-3afb-8891-4e4c511d7988",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Séparation des troupes qui composent une armée."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5de2c53e-a0fb-3c8e-a7c1-a605b26819e2",
                        "entry_id": "9320fbeb-fe12-3afb-8891-4e4c511d7988",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Déplacement d’un ou plusieurs syntagmes en début ou à la fin de la phrase, négligeant la structure ordinaire définie par le verbe."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c4f8a186-befa-4197-ac77-e037e4952962",
                        "source_entry_id": "9320fbeb-fe12-3afb-8891-4e4c511d7988",
                        "source_sense_description": "Déplacement",
                        "target_lang_word": "dislocation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dislocation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "284e9822-56b7-332a-a0c8-576e183d4691",
                                        "entry_id": "53449283-8cbe-3180-8a7e-1af98d6b339c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of displacing, or the state of being displaced."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3198571f-c6ef-4d21-8227-7ff0109a451d",
                                                "sense_id": "284e9822-56b7-332a-a0c8-576e183d4691",
                                                "text": "As mentioned last month in the article \"Railways and the War,\" the emergency timetables were planned in view of the possibility of serious dislocation of transport by air raids in the early days of the war, and were regarded as the minimum service which would keep the activities of the country alive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9ba4716-9bb5-4bad-b22f-97b7115aee0f",
                                                "sense_id": "284e9822-56b7-332a-a0c8-576e183d4691",
                                                "text": "At large stations such as Euston and Birmingham New Street, it is essential to compress the station reconstruction, re-signalling and overhead wiring into the shortest possible time, not only to minimise the period of traffic dislocation but also to ensure completion by the time the remainder of the lines is electrified."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28458087-d0ab-4ef6-8be5-664050e77c24",
                                                "sense_id": "284e9822-56b7-332a-a0c8-576e183d4691",
                                                "text": "Let's hope someone can get an original Spanish print for U.S. distribution; the redubbed Mexican version shown at the Festival does a disservice to the fine performances by its slight (but annoying) dislocations of sound and image."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3193d2df-ff5a-3038-8d87-32304a7a0553",
                                        "entry_id": "53449283-8cbe-3180-8a7e-1af98d6b339c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The displacement of parts of rocks or portions of strata from the situation which they originally occupied."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9db09db-8173-330d-9b95-be1bdd74c2c6",
                                        "entry_id": "53449283-8cbe-3180-8a7e-1af98d6b339c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of dislocating, or putting out of joint; also, the condition of being thus displaced."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a4c059a-ef71-416c-a361-a2b2ad10fd28",
                                                "sense_id": "e9db09db-8173-330d-9b95-be1bdd74c2c6",
                                                "text": "They used steroids to build strength but, more importantly, to recover from strains, pulls, dislocations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e128a2f-a902-3fcf-a22b-103f0c3cf23f",
                                        "entry_id": "53449283-8cbe-3180-8a7e-1af98d6b339c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A linear defect in a crystal lattice. Because dislocations can shift within the crystal lattice, they tend to weaken the material, compared to a perfect crystal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4ee5813-43d3-3583-b849-c7ee7112fa73",
                                        "entry_id": "53449283-8cbe-3180-8a7e-1af98d6b339c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sentence structure in which a constituent that could otherwise be either an argument or an adjunct of a clause occurs outside of and adjacent to the clause boundaries."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb2f3b4b-ee86-3caa-b39a-d24264c37779",
                                        "entry_id": "53449283-8cbe-3180-8a7e-1af98d6b339c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In men's gymnastics, a rotating of the shoulders when performing a backwards turn on the still rings. Many skills in acrobatics appear to involve dislocating a joint, when they actually do not."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d14c7c5e-96b0-4e0d-bb1a-7af3e9faf8a3",
                                                "sense_id": "bb2f3b4b-ee86-3caa-b39a-d24264c37779",
                                                "text": "The practice of contortion can be divided into three categories: backbending, frontbending and dislocation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
